  Slug: echo-of-lost-moments
  DisplayName: Echo of Lost Moments
  IconPath: icons/magic/time/day-night-sunset-sunrise.webp
  Description: "Echoes of lost moments are apparitions born from memories that everyone
    has forgotten, often arising from fragmented pieces of magic and memory left
    behind by time-altering magic. They may even occur in response to significant
    temporal tampering, cleaning up fragments of time damaged by irresponsible magic.
    These apparitions are drawn to animists who are orderly and responsible, and
    they can give such hosts access to spells that alter a target's timeline or removes
    them from the current timeline, reveal visions of past or future events, or even
    accelerate magical effects to a point in time where they have already ended.
    Apparition Skills Fortune-Telling Lore, Genealogy Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Figment] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.D\xE9j\xE0
    Vu] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispel Magic] 3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Curse
    of Lost Time] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vision of Death] 5th
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Scene] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal
    Calamity] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Retrocognition] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary]
    9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Foresight] Vessel Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Store
    Time] Avatar Devourer of Lost Time Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 50 feet Melee 1 devour
    potential (reach 15 feet, void), Damage @Damage[(6d10+6)[void]] Ranged 1 scream
    of loss (range 120 feet, void), Damage @Damage[(6d6+6)[void]]"
